  what do you think of this approach do  you care that avatar could soon be at  the top or are you happy about the  comeback against  marvel as avatar fans who pursued a  similar strategy back then  feel free to write us a comment down  below  after many film studios have looked  optimistically into the spring of 2021  according to variety universal pictures  is the first of the big five major  studios to decide to postpone its  announced films  in some cases quite severely the  long-awaited fast and furious nine is  the one least affected by this  here the release is only postponed by  about four weeks from the end of may  to june 25th 2021 paramount is pursuing  a different strategy with john  krasinski's a quiet place part 2. for  here they even decided to push  forward the theatrical release from  september to may 28th  the late summer slot will be given to  antoine fuqua's sci-fi blockbuster  infinite starring mark wahlberg dylan  o'brien and rupert friend  it will be released on september 24th  2021  unfortunately its minions the rise of  grew the hardest  because here it has been decided to  delay the release by almost a whole year  meaning that you will not be able to  watch the sequel to the extremely  successful first part before july 1  2022 as sony revealed on twitter a few  days ago an animated musical called  k-pop demon hunters is currently in  production  after south korean pop music gained a  lot of popularity in the last few years  it was actually only a question of time  until it would be also thematically  covered in movies behind the scenes  ninjago director maggie kang and with  dragon director chris apple hands will  be in charge  according to variety the plot will  revolve around the south korean girl  group who are secretly demon unders in  addition to their world famous tours  k-pop demon hunters will belong to the  action adventure genre is set to be set  in a colorful  animated world the script is currently  being written by hannah mcmakin and  daniel jimenez who are also known as  hanyo while oscar winner aaron warner is  serving as  producer we're looking forward to  further news an official release date is  unfortunately  not yet known at the start of january  tessa thompson already confirmed that  the comic michael b  jordan could take over the direction of  the upcoming creed 3.  until recently the responsible parties  were reluctant to say anything  but now it's clear the black panther  actor will indeed soon make his debut in  the director's chair  in a statement jordan shared that this  had always been his dream and that he'd  only been waiting for the right moment  he had the privilege to learn from  hollywood biggies such as ryan coogler  and denzel  washington and is now ready enough for  the next step however  that's not all as the long-awaited u.s  release date was also announced in the  process  and has been set for the thanksgiving  weekend at the end of november  2022 while there's no information about  the plot of cree 3 currently  one can look optimistically into the  coming weeks and months considering that  shooting is sure to start soon  [Music]

